# 白名单：默认忽略一切，只放行代码和文档。书、配置、术语表、输出等数据放在仓库外的工作区。
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!LICENSE
!pyproject.toml
!.githooks/
!.githooks/*
!.github/
!.github/*.yml
!.github/*.md
!.github/CODEOWNERS
!.github/workflows/
!.github/workflows/*.yml
!CONTRIBUTING.md
!SECURITY.md
!requirements.txt
!requirements-dev.txt
!doctrans/
!doctrans/*.py
!doctrans/*.css
!tests/
!tests/*.py
!examples/
!examples/*.toml
!examples/*.csv
!skill/
!skill/*.md
!docs/
!docs/*.md
